 {
  "action": "update",
  "element_id": "482868c0",
  "settings": {
   "paragraph": "Xtreme is owned and run by Axiom's founder. It takes riders from St. Petersburg into open Gulf water: Egmont Key, Shell Key, Fort De Soto, sandbars and dolphins, with a local guide out front. It's where we use the website, marketing and follow-up systems we offer through Axiom, on a business we run ourselves."
  }
 },
 {
  "action": "update",
  "element_id": "293c0285",
  "settings": {
   "paragraph": "Someone looking at a jet ski tour wants three answers fast: where does it go, is there a spot, and how do I book? The site had to answer all three before anyone scrolls, and every inquiry needed a reply, even on a busy day on the water."
  }
 },
 {
  "action": "update",
  "element_id": "13a5b560",
  "settings": {
   "paragraph": "A bold site over real ride footage. Where the ride goes, Check Availability and a call button come first. Every tour has its length, its price and a Book button that opens online booking. Behind the site, inquiries are captured and followed up with the same automations Axiom plans include."
  }
 },
